### 1.2a KPI Card Pattern (BẮT BUỘC)

Mọi KPI card trên Dashboard, Outstanding, Operations, Reports PHẢI dùng pattern horizontal icon + value:

```tsx
// ✅ ĐÚNG — KPI Card chuẩn (Dashboard hero-kpis, Operations kpi-strip, Outstanding)
function KpiCard({ icon: Icon, iconBg, iconColor, label, value, sub }) {
  return (
    <div className="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border bg-card p-4 shadow-sm">
      <div className={cn("flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg", iconBg)}>
        <Icon className={cn("size-5", iconColor)} />
      </div>
      <div className="min-w-0 flex-1">
        <p className="text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground">{label}</p>
        <p className="text-lg font-bold tabular-nums text-foreground">{value}</p>
        <p className="truncate text-xs text-muted-foreground">{sub}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
```

**Quy tắc:**
- **Container:** `rounded-xl border bg-card p-4 shadow-sm` — KHÔNG dùng `shadcn Card` cho KPI
- **Icon:** `size-10 rounded-lg` với nền màu semantic: `bg-{color}-100 dark:bg-{color}-900/50`
- **Icon glyph:** `size-5` với màu tương ứng: `text-{color}-600 dark:text-{color}-400`
- **Label:** `text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground`
- **Value:** `text-lg font-bold tabular-nums text-foreground`
- **Sub text:** `text-xs text-muted-foreground`
- **Grid:** `grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5` (5 KPI) hoặc `sm:grid-cols-4` (4 KPI)

**Bảng màu icon chuẩn:**

| Mục đích | iconBg | iconColor |
|----------|--------|-----------|
| Kỳ quay / Active draws | `bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/50` | `text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400` |
| Entries / Lượt cược | `bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/50` | `text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400` |
| Lines / Dòng cược | `bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/50` | `text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400` |
| Hoa hồng | `bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50` | `text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400` |
| Doanh thu / Tiền cược | `bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/50` | `text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400` |
| GGR | `bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/50` | `text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400` |
| Lợi nhuận | `bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/50` | `text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400` |
| Người chơi | `bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/50` | `text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400` |

```tsx
// ❌ SAI — dùng shadcn Card vertical layout cho KPI
<Card className="gap-0 py-0">
  <CardHeader className="px-5 pb-2 pt-4">
    <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
      <Icon className="size-4 text-muted-foreground" />
      <CardTitle className="text-sm font-semibold">Label</CardTitle>
    </div>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent className="px-5 pb-4 pt-0">
    <p className="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight tabular-nums">{value}</p>
  </CardContent>
</Card>
```

