### 1.3 Page Layout Chuẩn

Mọi trang dashboard PHẢI theo thứ tự:

```
1. PageHeader     — title + subtitle + icon gradient (bên trái) · global controls (bên phải)
2. FilterBar      — tenant / game / date range / status / search  [optional]
3. KPI Row        — 3–6 KpiCard
4. Analytics Row  — chart / heatmap / trend
5. Data Row       — DataTable (sticky header) + optional RightDrawer
6. States         — loading skeleton · empty state · error state
```

**Grid:** `grid grid-cols-12 gap-6` · Cards span 3–4 cols  
**Section vertical spacing:** `space-y-6` hoặc `space-y-8`

