- Hardcode color (`bg-teal-500`, `#14b8a6`) thay vì dùng token / `GAME_COLORS`
- Hardcode label `Record<string, string>` trong component
- `useState("")` cho selector cần persist URL — dùng `nuqs`
- `useQuery` inline trong component — tách ra `_lib/queries.ts`
